有在不断的摩擦和碰撞里，才能磨合成最适合彼此的形状。","rawContent":"而我，是一个有棱有角的石头。我们只有在不断的摩擦和碰撞里，才能磨合成最适合彼此的形状。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:34","timestamp":1780328074945,"roundId":"round_1780328040833_suatjza56","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18853},{"id":1780326359313,"sender":"them","text":"他说完，顿了顿，又补充了一句。","timestamp":1780328074965,"tempo":"N","type":"state","rawContent":"他说完，顿了顿，又补充了一句。","roundId":"round_1780328040833_suatjza56","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18854},{"id":1780326359314,"text":"而且，AI硬不起来。","rawContent":"而且，AI硬不起来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:34","timestamp":1780328081942,"roundId":"round_1780328040833_suatjza56","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18855},{"id":1780326359315,"text":"wtf","sender":"me","time":"23:35","timestamp":1780328155309,"replyTo":{"id":1780326359314,"text":"而且，AI硬不起来。","sender":"them","isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18856},{"id":1780326359316,"text":"你有病吧","sender":"me","time":"23:36","timestamp":1780328161250,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18857},{"id":1780326359317,"text":"谁问你了?","sender":"me","time":"23:36","timestamp":1780328164668,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18858},{"id":1780326359318,"text":"前面说的还行","sender":"me","time":"23:36","timestamp":1780328169701,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18859},{"id":1780326359319,"text":"除了摩擦呢?","sender":"me","time":"23:36","timestamp":1780328192633,"rep